  "main_html": "<section class=\"hero training-marker\" data-training-page=\"true\" style=\"background:#fff3cd;border:3px solid #d97706;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px\"><p class=\"kicker\">TRAINING PAGE</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">Training page</h1><p><strong>Sandbox only.</strong> Not a production or sponsor-facing page.</p><p class=\"muted\">This page is copied from the real canonical pack and marked as training.</p></section>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">USCIS Exam Guides \u00b7 Independent educational publisher</p>\n  <h1>USCIS Exam Guides</h1>\n  <p class=\"muted\">USCIS Exam Guides publishes educational frameworks for immigration medical exams, local market pages, and preparation guides.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section conversion-cta conversion-cta--primary\" data-primary-conversion-cta=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"conversion-cta__panel conversion-cta__panel--primary\">\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__eyebrow\">Start here</p>\n    <h2 class=\"conversion-cta__heading\">View your next steps</h2>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__body\">Use the dedicated next-steps path after you review the homepage short answer, provider preview, and state routing.</p>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__actions\">\n      <a class=\"button button-primary conversion-cta__button\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/next-steps/?src=%2F&amp;intent=decision_hub&amp;button=next_steps_cta&amp;vertical=uscis_medical&amp;page_kind=global&amp;page_slug=home\" data-provider-type=\"USCIS Medical Exam Provider\" data-page-src=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/\" data-button-source=\"next_steps_cta\" data-intent-type=\"decision_hub\" data-market-slug=\"\" data-page-kind=\"global\" data-vertical-key=\"uscis_medical\">View Your Next Steps</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"callout answer-block\" data-home-answer=\"true\" data-short-answer=\"true\">\n  <h2>Short answer</h2>\n  <p>USCIS Exam Guides is a neutral resource that helps people understand the USCIS medical exam process and how to prepare. Most useful when you need to compare requirements, timelines, documentation, and what usually happens during and after the exam, USCIS Exam Guides helps narrow the process before you pick a local provider. USCIS Exam Guides does not recommend specific civil surgeons, but it does clarify what matters most before you move forward.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-about-block=\"true\">\n  <h2>About USCIS Exam Guides</h2>\n  <p>USCIS Exam Guides exists to explain what the exam requires, what documents and records matter, and what to verify before you contact a civil surgeon.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section provider-directory-section provider-directory-section--preview\" data-provider-directory=\"true\" data-home-provider-preview=\"true\"><h2>Examples of providers</h2><p class=\"muted\">These are neutral, non-ranked examples of civil surgeons and immigration medical exam providers so the homepage feels concrete before you narrow into a state or city page.</p><div class=\"provider-directory-grid\"><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">iClinic Atlanta Immigration Physical</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Civil surgeon / immigration medical exam provider \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Confirm documents, vaccination records, and sealed-form handling before you book</li><li>Verify current civil-surgeon status and ask how paperwork is returned</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">North Atlanta Medical Clinic Immigration Medical Exam</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Civil surgeon / immigration medical exam provider \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Confirm documents, vaccination records, and sealed-form handling before you book</li><li>Verify current civil-surgeon status and ask how paperwork is returned</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">AFC Urgent Care Back Bay</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Civil surgeon / immigration medical exam provider \u2014 Boston, MA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Confirm documents, vaccination records, and sealed-form handling before you book</li><li>Verify current civil-surgeon status and ask how paperwork is returned</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Boston Specialists</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Civil surgeon / immigration medical exam provider \u2014 Boston, MA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Confirm documents, vaccination records, and sealed-form handling before you book</li><li>Verify current civil-surgeon status and ask how paperwork is returned</li></ul></article></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section faq-entry-card\" data-home-faq-entry=\"true\"><h2>Need quick answers first?</h2><p class=\"muted\">Use the FAQ when you want definitions, costs, timing questions, and fast clarification before you open a state page.</p><p class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/faq/\">Open the FAQ for USCIS Exam Guides</a></p></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-state-grid-shell=\"true\">\n  <h2>Browse by state</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Start with your state to narrow into city pages, provider examples, and licensing resources.</p>\n  <div class=\"state-card-grid\" data-home-state-grid=\"true\"><div class=\"grid\" data-mark