item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/costs-and-timeframes/\"><strong>uscis medical exam cost timeline and sealed envelope questions</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Costs and timing</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"documents\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/document-checklist/\"><strong>uscis medical exam document checklist and what to bring</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 Document checklist</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"requirements\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/i-693-medical-exam-requirements/\"><strong>i-693 medical exam requirements and civil surgeon process</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 I-693 requirements</span></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fanout-query-group\" id=\"next\"><h3>Core discovery paths</h3><ul class=\"fanout-query-list\"><li class=\"fanout-query-item\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/after-your-exam-next-steps/\"><strong>what happens after a uscis medical exam</strong></a><span class=\"fanout-query-path\"> \u2192 After exam next steps</span></li></ul></div></div></details>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <h2>Start with the strongest decision paths</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/\">Guides hub</a></h3><p>Neutral checklists for I-693 requirements, vaccination records, fees, and timelines.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/guides/document-checklist/\">Document checklist</a></h3><p>Use this before you book so you know what records to gather first.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3><a href=